# Text is LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever the platform's Git
# settings: a shell script with CRLF does not run, and a wheel built from CRLF data
# files differs from one built elsewhere. PowerShell scripts are the exception.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
